# Nmap's XML: the elements and attributes the reader looks for, taken from
# `src/import/report/nmap.rs`, plus the constructs the parser exists to refuse.
#
# The refusals matter as much as the vocabulary. `<!ENTITY`, an internal subset
# and an external identifier are the shapes an XXE takes, and a fuzzer that
# never spells one never tests that they are turned away.

